						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Yeah I played CoH (worst mistake EVER) and then moved to WoW.&nbsp; I did one MC run with my hunter but left that guild when all the quality players left.&nbsp; Want to do more but most MC guilds are full of hunters so I&#039;m working on the druid.&nbsp; Actually what I miss the most is playing my Bard from EQ.&nbsp; That class allowed me to do more then anything I&#039;ve found to date.<br /><br />With the changes to 1.7 I&#039;m moving back to the hunter because my pet is so freakin beefy.&nbsp; My cat has over 3300 hps and over 5k armor so in tanking it spits on me <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/smiley1.gif" alt="Smiley" border="0" /></td>
