						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Hey druids do well as healers in WoW.&nbsp; The biggest problem of course is not the game design but the players.&nbsp; To the majority of players you have to have one person taking the damage, one person healing the damage, and everyone else beating on the mob.&nbsp; When the game trys to force you to use a different approach people get pissy and whine.&nbsp; Some of the most fun I&#039;ve had is doing the Windsor escort quest with Pallys and Hunters.<br /><br />Oh and on my druid I&#039;ve filled the role of healer just as well as any priest (for my level).&nbsp; Hell I&#039;m even better because I can ress the mage during combat (mainly so I can watch them die again)<br /><br />Kashana - 60 Hunter<br />Erind - 42 Druid<br />Garona</td>
